# Normalise line endings so Godot files diff cleanly across Mac/Windows/Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.glb binary
*.ttf binary

# Git LFS is deliberately NOT on yet: PS1-scale assets are tiny, and LFS on
# GitHub has bandwidth quotas that CI checkouts eat. Revisit if art/audio > ~200 MB.
# *.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
